# Optional personal-build PUBLIC Google Chrome extension OAuth client ID.
# Use your OWN Cloud project, never a shared publisher project/quota.
# This is not a secret. Never add a client secret, refresh token, or access token here.
# Obtain an OAuth client of type Chrome Extension for your stable extension ID.
MOCHI_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Optional GitHub Pages project base, including both slashes.
# The deployment workflow supplies /REPOSITORY_NAME/ automatically.
MOCHI_BASE_PATH=./

# Optional PUBLIC repository fallback on a non-Actions static host.
# Actions supplies it automatically. Use OWNER/REPOSITORY; never a token or URL.
MOCHI_REPOSITORY=
